<p>Your knowledge of entropy allows you to defy the laws of physics, allowing you to better endure your entropic energies.</p><p>You take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">40%, 54%, 65%, 74%, 80%</acronym> less damage from your entropic backlash.</p><p>You may activate this talent to instantly remove your current Entropy.</p>